OL,3,AThousands without power as Isaias
OL,4,Aprompts evacuation orders across Gulf
OL,5,ACoast
OL,6,
OL,7,FHurricane Isaias is likely to bring a
OL,8,F"life-threatening storm surge" to the
OL,9,FUS Gulf Coast when it makes landfall,
OL,10,Fthe National Hurricane Center warns
OL,12,FThousands are without power in the
OL,13,Fcountry's southeast - and Alabama,
OL,14,FFlorida and Georgia have issued states
OL,15,Fof emergency as they brace for heavy
OL,16,Frains and flooding
OL,18,F"Get out NOW!" warn some Florida
OL,19,Fofficials, urging residents to follow
OL,20,Fevacuation orders as the state feels
OL,21,Fthe storm's initial impacts
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
